# saleae-box: only sources go into git. Everything below is downloaded, solved or produced again by
# ./saleae-box bootstrap | install | examples test (pins: pixi.toml + pixi.lock, pixi sha256 in saleae-box).
# Logic 2 is proprietary: the AppImage is fetched only by `install --accept-license` and never committed.
